    symmetry: LR + UD + rot90 + rot180 [observed]
    connectivity: 4-connected or 8-connected (1-4 components in 4-conn)
  sprites:
    count: 2-4 distinct foreground colors, each showing a partial copy of the same template
    placement: top-left aligned within a template-sized window; windows never overlap and have gap >= 1 cell
    damage: each sprite is missing 7-33% of template pixels (1-6 pixels), scattered randomly within the template mask
    coverage: union of ALL sprite masks exactly recovers the full template (every template pixel is present in >= 1 sprite)
