0026:     - The first row above the source starts a two-cell horizontal band at the source column; each next row shifts that band one column right.
0027:     - If the band would touch a blocker in its row, shift it further right until both band cells avoid blockers.
0028:     - When such an extra shift leaves a gap from the previous row's band, fill the gap on the previous row with the source color.
0029:     - Stop when the band has moved completely past the right edge.
0030: 
0031:     Key insight
